<header id="page-top">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="heading">
            <h1>
                Disaster-Ready Communities
            </h1>
            <span class="font-size-medium">Turn your friend network into a proficient disaster response team, ready to meet urgent needs in your own community.</span>
            <div style="max-width:450px; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px; color:white;">
                For Emergency Management Professionals, Stability offers simulation features that transitions from planning into a coordinated, community-empowered response during disasters.
           	</div>
			<a class="btn btn-success btn-sm btn-w-m" role="button" page-scroll href="#groupResponse">Read More</a>
			<a class="btn btn-success btn-sm btn-w-m" role="button" href="/SignIn">Sign In</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>
