<section>
    <div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-md-4 m-b-lg" style="margin-bottom:100px;">
				<h4>Citizens, Help Your Community Be Disaster-Ready</h4>
				<p>
					When disasters strike, communities need more than just good intentions—they need a team ready to act. Stability empowers everyday citizens like you to join forces with local community-based groups to provide meaningful disaster relief. By leveraging your unique skills, resources, and time, you can make a real difference in the lives of those affected by hurricanes, floods, wildfires, and other crises.
				</p>
				<a class="btn btn-success m-b-sm" style="font-size:20px; font-weight:bold;" role="button" page-scroll href="/V1/Register.aspx?type=volunteer">Volunteer Here</a>
				<p><a class="btn-info btn btn-sm btn-w-m" role="button" page-scroll href="#citizenResponse">Learn more</a></p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4 m-b-lg" style="margin-bottom:100px;">
				<h4>Community Groups, Why Stability Matters</h4>
				<p>
					When disasters strike, there’s no time for lengthy preparation. Stability instantly transforms your organization into a disaster-ready team with pre-designed programs, training, and real-time coordination tools. We enable you to mobilize your members, harness their unique skills, and deliver meaningful support when it matters most.
				</p>
				<a class="btn btn-success m-b-sm" role="button" page-scroll href="/V1/Register.aspx?type=group">Groups Register Here</a>
				<p><a class="btn-info btn btn-sm btn-w-m" role="button" page-scroll href="#groupResponse">Learn more</a></p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4 m-b-lg" style="margin-bottom:100px;">
				<h4>Emergency Management Professionals</h4>
				<p>
					Stability empowers emergency managers to effectively coordinate with community-based groups, allowing for a well-prepared, efficient disaster response. Our platform not only facilitates real-time coordination but also enables pre-planning with local groups, ensuring that when disaster strikes, community teams are ready to act with minimal delay.
				</p>
					<a class="btn btn-success m-b-sm" role="button" page-scroll href="/V1/Register.aspx?type=professional">Emergency Management Professionals Register Here</a>
				<p><a class="btn-info btn btn-sm btn-w-m" role="button" page-scroll href="#emergencyManagementProfessionals">Learn more</a></p>
			</div>
		</div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="groupResponse" class="bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-md-offset-3 text-center">
                <h2><span class="text-info">Community Group and Nonprofit </span>Response</h2>
                <p>
					Whether you're a church, civic group, disater nonprofit or neighborhood association, Stability gives you the tools and training to take swift, organized action during a crisis.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row m-t-lg">
            <div class="col-md-4 col-md-offset-2">
                <strong>Rapid Response Programs:</strong>
                <p>
					 Quickly access and deploy ready-to-go disaster response programs tailored for your community’s needs.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <strong>Member Skill Coordination:</strong>
                <p>
					Leverage the skills, resources, and availability of your members to make the greatest impact.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-4 col-md-offset-2">
                <strong>Training for Action:</strong>
                <p>
					 Equip your group with essential disaster response training, ensuring that everyone is prepared to contribute effectively.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <strong>Real-Time Monitoring:</strong>
                <p>
					 Track your team’s time, actions and resources, ensuring your community benefits from the most efficient use of FEMA matching funds.
                </p>
                <a class="btn btn-success btn-sm" href="/V1/Register.aspx?type=group">Groups Get Started Here</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row m-t-lg">
            <div class="col-md-8 col-md-offset-2">
                <strong>FREE: One Click to Launch a Custom Website That Coordinates and Engages Your Members and Community</strong>
                <p>
					 Coordinate with Your Own Custom Website: Stability enables your team to launch a custom website, allowing you to organize, communicate, and coordinate all efforts seamlessly.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="citizenResponse">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-md-offset-3 text-center">
                <h2><span class="text-info">Citizens and Team </span>Members</h2>
                <p>
                   Join Stability – Help Your Community Be Disaster-Ready, Be Part of the Solution
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row m-t-lg">
            <div class="col-md-4 col-md-offset-2">
                <strong>Put Your Skills to Use:</strong>
                <p>
					 Whatever your background—medical, logistics, communications, or general support—there’s a place for you on your local disaster response team.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <strong>Make an Impact:</strong>
                <p>
					Every hour you contribute and every resource you provide directly helps your community secure vital disaster relief.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-4 col-md-offset-2">
                <strong>Be Prepared:</strong>
                <p>
					Get trained and ready before disasters strike, so you can be part of a team that knows exactly how to help in times of crisis.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <strong>Connect with Local & National Partners:</strong>
                <p>
					Work with Local & National Partners: Through Stability, your group collaborates with emergency managers and disaster relief organizations, ensuring your efforts are coordinated and effective.
                </p>
                <a class="btn btn-success btn-sm" href="/V1/Register.aspx?type=member">Volunteer Register Here</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="emergencyManagementProfessionals" class="bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-md-offset-3 text-center">
                <h2><span class="text-info">Emergency Management </span>Professionals</h2>
                <p>
                   Streamline Your Disaster Response with Pre-Planned Community Support. Stability empowers emergency managers to effectively coordinate with community-based groups, allowing for a well-prepared, efficient disaster response. Our platform not only facilitates real-time coordination but also enables pre-planning with local groups, ensuring that when disaster strikes, community teams are ready to act with minimal delay.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row m-t-lg">
            <div class="col-md-4 col-md-offset-2">
                <strong>Pre-Planning with Community Groups:</strong>
                <p>
					 Collaborate with community-based groups ahead of time to build a pre-planned disaster response strategy, ensuring they’re ready to act when needed.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <strong>Real-Time Monitoring:</strong>
                <p>
					Track every hour of work and every donated resource, ensuring accurate records that can be applied toward the community’s required matching funds, helping secure federal disaster relief funding.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-4 col-md-offset-2">
                <strong>Resource & Skill Tracking:</strong>
                <p>
					Get trained and ready before disasters strike, so you can be part of a team that knows exactly how to help in times of crisis.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <strong>Strategic Deployments:</strong>
                <p>
					Use our platform to deploy groups based on their strengths, ensuring an organized and effective disaster response.
                </p>
                <a class="btn btn-success btn-sm" href="/V1/Register.aspx?type=professional">Emergency Managers Get Started Here</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section id="team">
